# Suite run (plan 04-06, D-08, A-06): run, observation, buffer and input tests through the public
# API, in their own executable (the 512-case machine suite and its per-fault reruns stay bounded).
# Family observe (plan 04-06): ivs_machine_cpu_state (OFF, after reset, after stepped units of
# stand-in program A, flag mapping, the out-struct size rule), ivs_machine_peek (loaded words, the
# 10-bit mask, closed gates and undriven space equal to a CPU read, the address-space end), side-
# effect freedom over 1000 peeks and 1000 cpu_state calls OFF and POWERED, and the refusals of both
# calls with the SP4 oracle (status, whole-storage memcmp, digests and machine time equal, poisoned
# out kept).
