# Family bound (plan 04-07, D-01..D-05): ivs_machine_run to an absolute master-tick target. The
# expected boundaries come from a reference twin stepped unit by unit through the internal seam;
# targets inside a unit, on a boundary and already reached; overshoot over a window of targets;
# run(now + 1) equals one seam step.
run.target.ends-at-first-boundary-ge-target
run.target.on-boundary-no-overshoot
run.target.already-reached
run.overshoot.equals-now-minus-target
run.single-step.equals-seam
